      "text": "\"City employees\" means elected officials of the City of New York and employees of such officials, including employees of mayoral agencies, provided that such official's or employee's pay is processed by the Office of Payroll Administration, and provided, further, that the term \"City employees\" shall not include employees who are represented in collective bargaining.",
